---
title: "5.4.2 Sequence — registrasi domain dan HTTPS"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant DB as Postgres<br/>(domain_orders)
  participant WK as Worker<br/>(domain.register)
  participant RA as Reseller API<br/>(registrar)
  participant CF as Cloudflare<br/>for SaaS
  participant RS as Resend<br/>(email)
  DB->>+WK: order.paid (ada domain)
  WK->>DB: Kunci baris, status submitting
  WK->>RA: Cek saldo deposit
  RA-->>WK: saldo_rupiah
  opt saldo < biaya registrasi
    Note over WK: Tahan, ulang tiap jam hingga 24 jam
    WK->>RS: Peringatan admin, lalu failed_review
  end
  WK->>RA: Daftar 1 tahun (registran = pelanggan)
  RA-->>WK: sukses, atau habis waktu
  opt habis waktu atau 5xx (status unknown)
    WK->>RA: Cek info domain dulu, baru ulang
  end
  WK->>DB: Domain registered, terikat ke satu site
  WK->>RA: DNS: CNAME www ke target SaaS
  WK->>CF: Buat custom hostname (validasi HTTP)
  loop tiap 10 menit sampai TLS aktif
    WK->>CF: Cek status hostname + TLS
    CF-->>WK: pending / active
  end
  WK->>DB: Jadikan binding kanonik
  WK->>-RS: Email "Domain aktif" (≤ 24 jam)
